Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:17.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, man. Don't look at me like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.88,0:10:17.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托  别那样看着我
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She used to drive you nuts before too,remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.17,0:10:19.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}以前她也快把你逼疯  还记得吗
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:23.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, I'm crazy about her now. I think this could be the real thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.90,0:10:23.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是我现在为她疯狂  这次可能是真爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Capital R,capital T!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.08,0:10:24.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大写的真  大写的爱
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't worry,those are the right letters.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.12,0:10:28.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别担心  字母没拼错
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, what do you want me to say?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.57,0:10:33.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你到底要我说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:37.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- I want you to say that you like her! - I can't
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.46,0:10:37.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-我要你说你喜欢她  -我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}lt's like this chemical thing, you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.35,0:10:39.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就像是某种化学反应
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Every time she starts laughing,I just wanna...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.56,0:10:41.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}每次她一开口笑  我就想...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:48.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...pull my arm off just so I have something to throw at her.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.21,0:10:48.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}就想把我的手臂拧下来  好往她身上扔
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks for trying.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.75,0:10:51.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你的努力
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:58.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh,and by the way,there is no Count Rushmore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.47,0:10:58.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对了  根本就没有拉什莫尔公爵
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:01.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then who's the guy that painted the faces on the mountain?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.07,0:11:01.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是谁在拉什莫尔山上雕了那些总统肖像\N美国总统山又名拉什莫尔国家纪念碑  这才是字谜的正解
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:08.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How could you have told her?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.34,0:11:08.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么可以告诉她
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:11.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, I didn't think it would be that big a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.92,0:11:11.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  我是想又没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:13.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She didn't think it would be that big a deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.55,0:11:13.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她认为没什么大不了的
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, who are you talking to when you do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.14,0:11:16.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你想讨论这些的时候  你都会跟谁说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:21.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look,that was supposed to be a private,personal thing between us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.51,0:11:21.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这些应该是仅限于我们之间的私密对话
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:25.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, Ross, Phoebe is my girlfriend,okay? We tell each other everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.89,0:11:25.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比是我的闺蜜  好吗 我们无话不谈
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean, come on. You guys do the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.91,0:11:28.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托  男人也一样啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:31.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean,what about all that locker-room stuff?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.36,0:11:31.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那些更衣室里的对话怎么说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:32.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's different. Okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.41,0:11:32.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那不一样  
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's like, who dated a stripper?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.64,0:11:34.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们会聊  比如谁跟脱衣舞娘约会了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:38.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or who did it on the back of the Staten lsland ferry?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.62,0:11:38.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或谁在史坦登岛渡轮后面做爱
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Both of those Joey? - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.82,0:11:40.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-都是乔伊干的吧  -没错
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:45.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But you don't, you don't talk about like, you know, your girlfriend...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.68,0:11:45.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但是绝不会谈到自己的女朋友
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:48.15,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and the intimate stuff you do with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.02,0:11:48.15,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有和她之间亲密的事
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Not even with your best friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.81,0:11:50.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}连最好的朋友也不说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:50.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.17,0:11:50.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不说
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:52.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That is so sad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.22,0:11:52.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真可悲
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:55.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're missing out on so much, Ross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.91,0:11:55.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你们错过太多乐趣了  罗斯
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:59.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I mean,the bonding and the sharing, you know...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.86,0:11:59.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是种彼此维系  分享的乐趣
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:03.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...and knowing that someone else is going through the same thing you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.03,0:12:03.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}得知别人也有过和你一样的遭遇
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:07.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what, you tell each other everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.24,0:12:07.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那你们什么都跟对方说吗
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.74,0:12:09.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Pretty much.
