Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know,but it's still worth mentioning,I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.26,0:12:27.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  我想还是值得一提
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Relax every muscle in your body.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.12,0:12:33.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}全身肌肉放松
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:38.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen to the plinky-plunky music.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.30,0:12:38.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着叮叮咚咚的音乐
