Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:29.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The United States garrison at Fort Sumter was fired upon.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.55,0:19:29.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}美国驻守在萨姆特堡的部队受到炮轰
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:32.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It is now under bombardment by...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.23,0:19:32.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这场炮轰是由于...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.57,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Dad! What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.69,0:19:45.57,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}爸  你怎么来了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:50.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's your mother's bridge night,so l came into the city for a little Moni-cuddle.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.58,0:19:50.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你妈今晚打桥牌  所以我进城来抱抱莫妮卡
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:56.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Since when did you start smoking cigars?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.85,0:19:56.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你什么时候开始抽雪茄了
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:20:00.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't. I just like the smell of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:57.32,0:20:00.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有  只是喜欢闻它的味道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:05.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So what are you really doing here, dad?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.87,0:20:05.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你来这里真正的目的是什么
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:07.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I just wanted to make sure you're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.14,0:20:07.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只想确定一下你还好吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What makes you think that Why I might not be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.81,0:20:10.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我为什么会不好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:11.91,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I saw Richard.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.97,0:20:11.91,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我看到理查了
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:16.36,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how do you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.95,0:20:16.36,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你还好吗
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.38,0:20:18.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:21.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm just a little tired,but I'm okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.86,0:20:21.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是有点累  不过还好
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}-How's Richard doing? -You don't want to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.54,0:20:24.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}-理查怎么样了  -你不会想知道的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:27.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I really, really do.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.21,0:20:27.80,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很想知道
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well,he's doing terrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.29,0:20:30.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他的情况很糟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:33.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.97,0:20:33.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:37.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Worse than when he broke up with Barbara.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.29,0:20:37.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比他跟芭芭拉分手时还糟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're not just saying that,are you? 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.59,0:20:40.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你不是故意这么说的吧  
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:42.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No,the man is a mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.29,0:20:42.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那个男人简直一团糟
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}- Was he crying? - No.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.94,0:20:45.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他有没有哭
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:50.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think he was waiting till after you left,so he could cry?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.17,0:20:50.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得他会不会是要等你走后再哭 
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:51.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Maybe.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.91,0:20:51.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或许吧
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.99,0:20:55.27,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.99,0:20:55.27,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想也是
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:59.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey,relationships are hard. Like with your mom and me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.97,0:20:59.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝贝  感情这回事很难说  就像我跟你妈
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:02.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You know,after we graduated from college,we broke up for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.23,0:21:02.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}大学毕业后  我们曾分手过一阵子
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It seems her father,your grandfather...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.00,0:21:05.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她父亲  就是你祖父  似乎
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:08.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...wanted her to travel around Europe like he did.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.77,0:21:08.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}希望你妈跟他一样  到欧洲四处旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:11.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Of course,he got to do it on Uncle Sam's nickel...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:11.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}当然  他去欧洲是看在钱的份上
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:16.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... because he was also strafing German troop trains at the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.59,0:21:16.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为当时他也在猛轰德国军用列车
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:17.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}However....
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.32,0:21:17.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}然而
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.25,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay,here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.12,0:22:00.25,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  开始了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:04.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am Jabba's prisoner. And you...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.10,0:22:04.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是贾巴的囚犯  而你...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:06.67,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}... have a really weird look on your face.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.78,0:22:06.67,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你脸上的表情好诡异
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:08.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What? Honey,what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.46,0:22:08.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  甜心  有什么问题
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did I get wrong, did I get the hair wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:08.93,0:22:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的发型不对吗
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:11.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or what? 
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.84,0:22:11.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还是别的问题  
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:13.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Did you just picture it differently? What, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.51,0:22:13.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}跟你想像得不同  怎么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:16.49,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, no. It's not you. It's, it's....
Dialogue: 0,0:22:13.40,0:22:16.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不不  不是你的问题  是...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:25.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What is it? Come on, sweetie. You're,like,freaking me out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.14,0:22:25.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  拜托  甜心  你把我吓坏了
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:31.55,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I hate Chandler. The bastard ruined my life!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.63,0:22:31.55,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我恨钱德勒  那个混蛋毁了我的人生
